   "en": "......",
   "uk": "......",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_STG01_MNLG_GUARD_01_#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Hrrrgh... I will protect this...",
   "uk": "Гр-р-р... Я це захищу...",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_STG01_MNLG_GUARD_01__2#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "I will protect this...[n]It's my job...",
   "uk": "Я це захищу...[n]Це моя робота...",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_STG01_MNLG_GUARD_01__3#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Won't give this up...[n]Won't let them have it...",
   "uk": "Не віддам цього...[n]Не дам їм забрати...",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_STG01_MNLG_GUARD_01__4#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "This, important...[n]Important, I protect...",
   "uk": "Це важливе...[n]Важливе — я захищаю...",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_STG01_MNLG_GUARD_01__5#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Cannot... let this go...[n]Must protect... protect...",
   "uk": "Не можна... віддати...[n]Треба захищати... захищати...",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_STG01_MNLG_DEFEND_01#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "I'll curse you...",
   "uk": "Я тебе прокляну...",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_STG01_MNLG_DEFEND_01_2#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "I'll chase you out...",
   "uk": "Я тебе вижену...",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_STG01_MNLG_DEFEND_01_3#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Get out... Get out...",
   "uk": "Геть... Геть...",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_STG01_MNLG_DEFEND_01_4#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Curse the intruders...",
   "uk": "Прокляття порушникам...",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_STG01_MNLG_DEFEND_01_5#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Swift is heaven's vengeance...",
   "uk": "Небесна кара швидка...",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_NML04_MNLG_FREE_01_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Queen will not come out...[n]Not today, not tomorrow...",
   "uk": "Королева не вийде...[n]Ні сьогодні, ні завтра...",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_NML04_MNLG_FREE_01_0_2#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Hungry...[n]No food yet?",
   "uk": "Їсти хочу...[n]Їжі ще немає?",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_NML04_MNLG_FREE_01_0_3#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Put a new bandage on,[n]like that... My package[n]still hasn't arrived...",
   "uk": "Наліпила новий пластир,[n]ось так... Моя посилка[n]досі не прийшла...",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_NML04_MNLG_FREE_01_0_4#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Surfing the net till the[n]crack of dawn... Hacking,[n]hijacking, always logged on...",
   "uk": "Сиджу в мережі до самого[n]світанку... Злам,[n]перехоплення, завжди онлайн...",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_NML04_MNLG_FREE_01_0_5#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Wahhh... The outside world[n]is scary...Too scary...",
   "uk": "А-а-а... Зовнішній світ[n]страшний... Надто страшний...",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_NML04_MNLG_FREE_01_0_6#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Whose voice is that?[n]No one wants me?[n]Delete?",
   "uk": "Чий це голос?[n]Я нікому не потрібна?[n]Видалити?",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_NML04_MNLG_FREE_01_0_7#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Dizzy... Dizzy...[n]Falling down...",
   "uk": "Паморочиться... Паморочиться...[n]Падаю...",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_NML04_MNLG_FREE_01_0_8#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Cold... Red... It's all over![n]This is the end!",
   "uk": "Холодно... Червоне... Усьому кінець![n]Це кінець!",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_NML04_MNLG_FREE_01_0_9#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "No one's coming...[n]I don't need anyone!",
   "uk": "Ніхто не прийде...[n]Мені ніхто не потрібен!",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_NML04_MNLG_FREE_01_1#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Yes... I'll reset.[n]I have to...",
   "uk": "Так... я перезавантажусь.[n]Мушу...",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_NML04_MNLG_FREE_01_1_2#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Did it... break?[n]That's... no fun...",
   "uk": "Воно... зламалося?[n]Це... не весело...",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_NML04_MNLG_FREE_01_1_3#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Everything is trash...[n]Everything...",
   "uk": "Усе — мотлох...[n]Усе...",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_NML04_MNLG_FREE_01_1_4#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Electricity... important...[n]Life of machines...",
   "uk": "Електрика... важлива...[n]Життя машин...",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_NML04_MNLG_FREE_01_1_5#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Someone's there...[n]Must protect the queen...",
   "uk": "Тут хтось є...[n]Треба захистити королеву...",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_NML04_MNLG_FREE_01_1_6#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Don't want... bad[n]guys... Right...?",
   "uk": "Не хочу... поганих[n]людей... Так...?",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_NML04_MNLG_FREE_01_1_7#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "I told you so...[n]Why didn't you listen...?[n]Awful child...",
   "uk": "Я ж казала...[n]Чому ти не слухала...?[n]Жахлива дитина...",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_NML04_MNLG_FREE_01_1_8#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "I know, no one's really there...[n]I know, I know...",
   "uk": "Я знаю, тут насправді нікого...[n]Знаю, знаю...",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_NML04_MNLG_FREE_01_1_9#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Is that...? Finally...[n]Someone came...?",
   "uk": "Невже...? Нарешті...[n]Хтось прийшов...?",
   "note": ""
  },
